[
  {
    "doc_id": "D301",
    "scenic": "天坛公园",
    "sentence_id": 4,
    "document_start": 81,
    "document_end": 110,
    "text": "在建筑设计和建造上，非常特别，涵盖深刻的中国文化传统元素。",
    "content_sha256": "856bd8e1262edcc25ef83dee00bf60cb91d589312f5499ced49176bad99f4348",
    "sample_id": "R001",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D301",
    "scenic": "天坛公园",
    "sentence_id": 1,
    "document_start": 0,
    "document_end": 40,
    "text": "列入世界遗产的北京天坛公园里的祈年殿前身是大享殿建于嘉靖二十四年（1545年）。",
    "content_sha256": "856bd8e1262edcc25ef83dee00bf60cb91d589312f5499ced49176bad99f4348",
    "sample_id": "R002",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D303",
    "scenic": "天坛公园",
    "sentence_id": 3,
    "document_start": 164,
    "document_end": 224,
    "text": "今天只去了天坛这一个景点，中午去找在北京工作的朋友吃了告别饭，短短的几天很快就过去了，希望新的一年，都能像这几天一样美好",
    "content_sha256": "e0b62e1c19e8b5c2cf7d2f4d76e77dbe4218c586bb6455ce6d4a3068dcebf21a",
    "sample_id": "R003",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D301",
    "scenic": "天坛公园",
    "sentence_id": 7,
    "document_start": 173,
    "document_end": 222,
    "text": "最里面的4根钻金柱高度近20m，内圈之外的12根柱子被称为金柱，最外圈较小的12根木柱被称为檐柱。",
    "content_sha256": "856bd8e1262edcc25ef83dee00bf60cb91d589312f5499ced49176bad99f4348",
    "sample_id": "R004",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D301",
    "scenic": "天坛公园",
    "sentence_id": 19,
    "document_start": 416,
    "document_end": 451,
    "text": "对祈年殿有兴趣，两侧大殿里有祈年殿大展和遇见天坛展览，很值得细细看看。",
    "content_sha256": "856bd8e1262edcc25ef83dee00bf60cb91d589312f5499ced49176bad99f4348",
    "sample_id": "R005",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D303",
    "scenic": "天坛公园",
    "sentence_id": 2,
    "document_start": 109,
    "document_end": 164,
    "text": "祈年殿的人比较多，其他地方人明显少了很多，但也很值得一逛，各种建筑颜色很鲜明，尤其是在冬季里，拍出来格外好看\n",
    "content_sha256": "e0b62e1c19e8b5c2cf7d2f4d76e77dbe4218c586bb6455ce6d4a3068dcebf21a",
    "sample_id": "R006",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D105",
    "scenic": "故宫博物院",
    "sentence_id": 16,
    "document_start": 464,
    "document_end": 506,
    "text": "清乾隆十一年（公元1746年），这里建成了现在的南三所，正式官名还叫撷（念邪）芳殿。",
    "content_sha256": "aaa213a74d64110e3ae42ff1435f44ccec770e3aaee17b47d715a0dd05c6597e",
    "sample_id": "R007",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D102",
    "scenic": "故宫博物院",
    "sentence_id": 83,
    "document_start": 2451,
    "document_end": 2488,
    "text": "对这些数字的解读有“万物生存之数”，其中有前面说的“天一生水，地六成之”。",
    "content_sha256": "68435aab56e8b8e1489ae5a030ddc9adc34a1e7e0a4460d2c3a7d53fd9970fa3",
    "sample_id": "R008",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D105",
    "scenic": "故宫博物院",
    "sentence_id": 118,
    "document_start": 3484,
    "document_end": 3521,
    "text": "没听说莫奈像画《池塘·睡莲》那样画了多幅《日出·印象》，没得说，这是摹本。",
    "content_sha256": "aaa213a74d64110e3ae42ff1435f44ccec770e3aaee17b47d715a0dd05c6597e",
    "sample_id": "R009",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D102",
    "scenic": "故宫博物院",
    "sentence_id": 192,
    "document_start": 5594,
    "document_end": 5640,
    "text": "这是宫里藏书的地方，皇上逛园子的时候，可以到这里拿本书，举着书本迈着方步，显着皇上学而不厌。",
    "content_sha256": "68435aab56e8b8e1489ae5a030ddc9adc34a1e7e0a4460d2c3a7d53fd9970fa3",
    "sample_id": "R010",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D102",
    "scenic": "故宫博物院",
    "sentence_id": 124,
    "document_start": 3711,
    "document_end": 3752,
    "text": "这棵龙爪槐是明初所栽，可以看出人工嫁接的痕迹，现在长成了独眼海盗船长米空的模样。\n",
    "content_sha256": "68435aab56e8b8e1489ae5a030ddc9adc34a1e7e0a4460d2c3a7d53fd9970fa3",
    "sample_id": "R011",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D102",
    "scenic": "故宫博物院",
    "sentence_id": 59,
    "document_start": 1705,
    "document_end": 1738,
    "text": "嘉靖帝在此修院子也是有原因的，这个院子里是御花园的核心建筑钦安殿。",
    "content_sha256": "68435aab56e8b8e1489ae5a030ddc9adc34a1e7e0a4460d2c3a7d53fd9970fa3",
    "sample_id": "R012",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D205",
    "scenic": "颐和园",
    "sentence_id": 255,
    "document_start": 7401,
    "document_end": 7455,
    "text": "园内东南角有一石桥，桥头石坊上有乾隆题写的“知鱼桥”三字额，是引用了庄子和惠子在“秋水濠上”的争论而来的。\n",
    "content_sha256": "e6ce4ad6f3272382979a3d976a15aea4880ba0f32453d86814f0004ee4e0443c",
    "sample_id": "R013",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D202",
    "scenic": "颐和园",
    "sentence_id": 11,
    "document_start": 365,
    "document_end": 404,
    "text": "三山是指万寿山、香山、玉泉山，五园是指清漪园、静宜园、静明园、畅春园和圆明园。",
    "content_sha256": "24eca8479c1f164ca55eb4fcceab8ba25a3ae0ac1b39edcd31eb29e8668024fc",
    "sample_id": "R014",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D206",
    "scenic": "颐和园",
    "sentence_id": 96,
    "document_start": 3185,
    "document_end": 3226,
    "text": "由于当时没有工具运输这么大物件，要先修路，等到冬天再泼水冻冰，然后从冰上人拉马拽。",
    "content_sha256": "47cf16cf60b8f92f22709ddb12610daccb53eebea61860f4b9a344973cd74d7f",
    "sample_id": "R015",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D202",
    "scenic": "颐和园",
    "sentence_id": 69,
    "document_start": 2027,
    "document_end": 2068,
    "text": "建筑群依山而筑，万寿山前山，以八面三层四重檐的佛香阁为中心，组成巨大的主体建筑群。",
    "content_sha256": "24eca8479c1f164ca55eb4fcceab8ba25a3ae0ac1b39edcd31eb29e8668024fc",
    "sample_id": "R016",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D206",
    "scenic": "颐和园",
    "sentence_id": 130,
    "document_start": 4321,
    "document_end": 4378,
    "text": "据说，李莲英为了讨好老佛爷，特意从畅春园弄来这十二块石头，分别排列在排云门外的两侧，象征全国百姓都在向老佛爷祝寿。",
    "content_sha256": "47cf16cf60b8f92f22709ddb12610daccb53eebea61860f4b9a344973cd74d7f",
    "sample_id": "R017",
    "human_confirmed": false
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "D205",
    "scenic": "颐和园",
    "sentence_id": 142,
    "document_start": 4592,
    "document_end": 4623,
    "text": "院内花卉植有玉兰、海棠、牡丹等，名花满院，寓“玉堂富贵”之意。",
    "content_sha256": "e6ce4ad6f3272382979a3d976a15aea4880ba0f32453d86814f0004ee4e0443c",
    "sample_id": "R018",
    "human_confirmed": false
  }
]
